 <h3><u>Husain ki khatir</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Husain husain..(8)</p> 
  <p>Hui hai khalq ye duniya,<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR..</p> 
  <p>Imam-e-Asr hai zinda<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR..<br> Hui hai khalq ye duniya,<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR..</p> 
  <p>1)Kaha rasul se rab ne na sar uthana abhi,<br> Tumhari pusht pe baitha hua hai ibne Ali,<br> Badhado aaj ye sajda...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>2)Qalam uthaya tha taamire Karbala ke liye,<br> Wagarna jung thi kya ibne murtaza ke liye,<br> Hasan ne zapt kiya tha...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>3)Kaha wo noor sarapa, kaha makaan mera,<br> Sharaf ye farshe aza se mujhe naseeb hua,<br> Mere ghar aa gayi Zehra...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>4)Yahi daleel hai ek-dusre se ulfat ki,<br> Rizae rab ke liye kijiye azadari<br> Khuda ko kijiye sajda..<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>5)Mubahile ka asar Karbala me dekh liya,<br> Wahab ki maa tujhe pohche salaam qaim ka,<br> Khuda ko de diya beta..<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>6)Sila Hussain ki maadar se usko aisa mila,<br> Har ek shaheed ye markad me kar raha hai dua,<br> Ke maut aae dobara...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>7)Hai isliye bhi zaruri juloos me jaana,<br> Shumaar karte hai Abbas roze Aashura,<br> Ke gharse kaun hai nikla...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
  <p>8)Khuda ka shukr Takallum naseeb waala hu,<br> Mai apna maksade takhleek yaad rakhta hu,<br> Hai saans-saans meri Ya...<br> HUSSAIN KI KHATIR</p> 
